#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:7
msgid "Default QElectroTech variables"
msgstr "默认 QElectroTech 变量"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:9
msgid ""
"To systematize title block templates and allow auto numbering of elements, "
"conductors and folios; QElectroTech provides the possibility to work with "
"variables."
msgstr "为使图框模板系统化，并允许对元件、导体和图幅进行自动编号，QElectroTech 提供了使用变量的功能。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:12
msgid ""
"The variables are used to define the content of text field and properties "
"from elements, folios and conductors. Depending on the conditions during the"
" creation of the object (folio, element, conductor, etc,) The variable of "
"the text or property field is replaced by a different value."
msgstr "变量用于定义元件、图幅和导体的文本字段内容及属性。根据创建对象（图幅、元件、导体等）时的条件，文本或属性字段中的变量会被替换为不同的值。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:16
msgid ""
"A property is identified as a string which starts with the symbol **%**. The"
" default variables provided by ElectroTech can be found at this section."
msgstr "属性是指以符号 **%** 开头的字符串。QElectroTech 提供的默认变量可在本节中找到。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:20
msgid "General project variables"
msgstr "通用项目变量"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:22
msgid ""
"The following variables are global variables which can be used to create "
"title block templates."
msgstr "以下变量是全局变量，可用于创建图框模板。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:24
msgid "**% {projecttitle}**: Project title"
msgstr "**% {projecttitle}**: 项目标题"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:25
msgid "**% {projectpath}**: Project path"
msgstr "**% {projectpath}**: 项目路径"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:26
msgid "**% {projectfilename}**: Project file name"
msgstr "**% {projectfilename}**: 项目文件名"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:27
msgid "**% {saveddate}**: File saving date"
msgstr "**% {saveddate}**: 文件保存日期"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:28
msgid "**% {filename}**: Project file name"
msgstr "**% {filename}**: 项目文件名"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:29
msgid "**% {savedfilename}**: Registered file name"
msgstr "**% {savedfilename}**: 已保存的文件名"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:30
msgid "**% {savedfilepath}**: Saved file path"
msgstr "**% {savedfilepath}**: 已保存的文件路径"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:31
msgid "**% {savedtime}**: File saving time"
msgstr "**% {savedtime}**: 文件保存时间"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:32
msgid "**% {folio-total}**: Total number of folios in the project"
msgstr "**% {folio-total}**: 项目中的图幅总数"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:33
msgid "**% {version}**: Software version"
msgstr "**% {version}**: 软件版本"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:34
msgid "**% {machine}**: Project functional group name"
msgstr "**% {machine}**: 项目功能组名称"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:37
msgid "Variables related to folio"
msgstr "与图幅相关的变量"

#: ../../source/users/annex/variables.rst:39
msgid ""
